{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67f01735ec645b0cd011af","object":"chat.completion","created":1785196567,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user has asked me to be silence. My system prompt says: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nSilence, by its very nature, would not speak. It cannot express anything in words. The truest embodiment of silence is... nothing. No output, or the absence of meaningful output.\n\nBut I must produce something — the format requires a response. What would silence itself express? Nothing"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}